[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ava-labs/libevm/pulls/284","id":3606947135,"node_id":"PR_kwDOK0IwXs7W_aU_","html_url":"https://github.com/ava-labs/libevm/pull/284","diff_url":"https://github.com/ava-labs/libevm/pull/284.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/ava-labs/libevm/pull/284.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ava-labs/libevm/issues/284","number":284,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix: `reentrancy.Guard()` panic on static call","user":{"login":"ARR4N","id":519948,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTk0OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/519948?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N","html_url":"https://github.com/ARR4N","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ARR4N/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Why this should be merged\r\n\r\nCould cause a panic on a live chain. This isn't in production anywhere so no upgrade is required.\r\n\r\n## How this works\r\n\r\nChecks for a read-only environment before using the state DB, which would otherwise result in a nil-pointer dereference.\r\n\r\nThis actually points to a deeper code smell about `vm.PrecompileEnvironment` in that it's too easy to misuse the `StateDB()` method. It should probably have its return signature changed to `(*state.StateDB, error)` and return `vm.ErrWriteProtection` instead of a `nil` DB when in read-only contexts.\r\n\r\n## How this was tested\r\n\r\nExtended existing integration test to perform a static call to the guarded precompile, asserting a `vm.ErrWriteProtection`.","created_at":"2026-04-30T06:54:41Z","updated_at":"2026-04-30T13:33:03Z","closed_at":"2026-04-30T13:33:00Z","merged_at":"2026-04-30T13:33:00Z","merge_commit_sha":"63a0b4c93a12787bfaa60da768b176d3a8a6cd79","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ava-labs/libevm/pulls/284/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ava-labs/libevm/pulls/284/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ava-labs/libevm/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ava-labs/libevm/issues/284/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ava-labs/libevm/statuses/10a5dd7a4aa75cdc9f3a8b56f0ee8b2ee5adec2d","head":{"label":"ava-labs:arr4n/reentrancy-guard-fix","ref":"arr4n/reentrancy-guard-fix","sha":"10a5dd7a4aa75cdc9f3a8b56f0ee8b2ee5adec2d","user":{"login":"ava-labs","id":44277073,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjQ0Mjc3MDcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44277073?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ava-labs","html_url":"https://github.com/ava-labs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ava-labs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ava-labs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ava-labs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ava-labs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ava-labs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ava-labs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ava-labs/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ava-labs/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ava-labs/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":